  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Evil Star**: rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Deserted Dunes Welcome Weary Feet**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **The Castle in the Air**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **Anoxia**: back after 32 archived shows (926 days); rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2019-10-14** (recommended): soundboard; 19 songs; 93 min [1]\n- **king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-live-in-paris-19-audio**: source not stated; 19 songs; 93 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Sam Joseph, Stacey Wilson, and Gaspard De Meulemeester are credited in the notes [1]\n- Ambrose Kenny-Smith played harmonica, vocals, keys, and percussion during the performance [2]\n- Stu Mackenzie provided vocals, guitar, and keys for the concert [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2019-10-14**: taped by Sam Joseph, Stacey Wilson, Gaspard De Meulemeester; source: SBD > WAV [1]. Also: Stu Mackenzie authorized the release of audio masters and cover art for this recording [1]\n- **king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-live-in-paris-19-audio**: The show was recorded by Sam Joseph, Stacey Wilson, and Gaspard De Meulemeester [2]",
